1
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,360
=Episode 9=

2
00:00:08,759 --> 00:00:10,080
Lanterns for sale!

3
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:10,639
I like the one down there.

4
00:00:10,639 --> 00:00:11,719
Lanterns for sale!

5
00:00:12,799 --> 00:00:14,320
Come take a look!

6
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:15,439
Handmade lanterns for sale!

7
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:17,839
You like her,

8
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:18,839
don't you?

9
00:00:19,119 --> 00:00:19,560
I...

10
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:23,519
I've known you for over twenty years.

11
00:00:24,399 --> 00:00:25,719
I've rarely seen you like this.

12
00:00:25,879 --> 00:00:27,359
For a time, I even thought

13
00:00:27,679 --> 00:00:29,519
you'd spend the rest of your life

14
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:30,719
with that guy from Xuanhan.

15
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:32,359
Anyway, forget it.

16
00:00:33,079 --> 00:00:33,679
Let's not talk about him.

17
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,800
Lanterns! Lanterns for sale!

18
00:00:36,359 --> 00:00:36,800
Xi Yuan.

19
00:00:39,359 --> 00:00:40,079
I'll be back soon.

20
00:00:40,079 --> 00:00:40,359
Alright.

21
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:41,000
Go ahead.

22
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,840
Lanterns for sale!

23
00:00:43,039 --> 00:00:44,640
Lanterns for sale!

24
00:01:00,399 --> 00:01:01,200
Hmm?

25
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:02,840
What's this?

26
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:05,240
It's called a Whispering Bell.

27
00:01:05,679 --> 00:01:06,960
Just channel a little Spiritual Power
into it,

28
00:01:07,479 --> 00:01:09,520
and you can call me anytime, anywhere.

29
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:19,920
About why I came this time,

30
00:01:20,319 --> 00:01:21,879
I've already confirmed everything

31
00:01:21,879 --> 00:01:23,439
I needed to know.

32
00:01:23,439 --> 00:01:24,959
It's time I left.

33
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:26,079
Jin Yunlie.

34
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:33,680
I'm leaving Xi Yuan in your hands.

35
00:01:36,319 --> 00:01:37,799
Keep her safe.

36
00:01:37,959 --> 00:01:40,799
If you ever need me,
use this method to reach me.

37
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,120
What's he doing?

38
00:01:44,359 --> 00:01:45,560
What does he mean by that?

39
00:01:53,879 --> 00:01:54,920
What's this?

40
00:01:56,519 --> 00:01:57,599
What is this?

41
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:05,719
Back to the palace.

42
00:02:06,879 --> 00:02:07,599
Back to the palace?

43
00:02:08,040 --> 00:02:08,519
Right.

44
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:53,080
Jin Yunlie!

45
00:02:53,880 --> 00:02:56,440
♪Bridal splendor, a lifetime of love,
all of it was only a dream♪

46
00:02:57,000 --> 00:03:00,240
♪My beauty fades, my longing breaks,
my ink runs red and blurs with tears♪

47
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:03,240
♪Over three lives, love waxes and wanes,
love reveals itself without a word♪

48
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:06,560
♪Who can forget the dreams
once held and lost♪

49
00:03:06,879 --> 00:03:08,159
Jin Yunlie!

50
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:13,240
♪For whom does the wind shift so quiet♪

51
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:16,720
♪That is my silent confession in bloom♪

52
00:03:19,599 --> 00:03:21,319
Jin Yunlie!

53
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,560
Xi Yuan!

54
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:29,080
♪An everlasting love to hold,
forever made to last♪

55
00:03:30,760 --> 00:03:33,920
♪After the world fades away,
you alone stay in my sight♪

56
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:37,840
♪Rouge sachets and jade towers
can't match your dance in the light♪

57
00:03:38,199 --> 00:03:39,159
Xi Yuan!

58
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:41,879
Jin Yunlie!

59
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:44,439
Xi Yuan, can you hear me?

60
00:03:44,439 --> 00:03:44,879
Xi Yuan!

61
00:03:44,879 --> 00:03:45,639
Jin Yunlie!

62
00:03:54,319 --> 00:03:55,120
Xi Yuan!

63
00:03:58,360 --> 00:04:01,480
♪One glance to last forever,
just you and me♪

64
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:04,760
♪Though deep in bone this longing stays,
a few more glances cast♪

65
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,960
♪An everlasting love to hold,
forever made to last♪

66
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:11,800
♪After the world fades away,
you alone stay in my sight♪

67
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:15,720
♪Rouge sachets and jade towers
can't match your dance in the light♪

68
00:04:16,080 --> 00:04:20,720
♪Once the heart knows love's design,
it's you I seek, and intertwine♪

69
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:48,959
It's too crowded here.

70
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:56,519
Indeed, too crowded.

71
00:04:58,120 --> 00:04:58,600
Yeah.

72
00:05:20,399 --> 00:05:21,959
This thing's actually pretty handy.

73
00:05:22,279 --> 00:05:24,120
It lets you talk to someone
and locate them.

74
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:25,720
It must be pretty expensive.

75
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:28,519
My mother left this to me.

76
00:05:28,959 --> 00:05:30,399
It's the only pair in the world.

77
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,360
(Your mother left it to you?)

78
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:33,040
(Then...)

79
00:05:34,079 --> 00:05:34,800
(Then...)

80
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:41,399
Xi Yuan.

81
00:05:43,319 --> 00:05:44,839
Are you still willing to stay in Huyun?

82
00:05:45,319 --> 00:05:45,879
What?

83
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:48,199
If I told you

84
00:05:48,839 --> 00:05:51,000
that Chi Li is your own brother,

85
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:53,480
and that you're both Huangyan royals,

86
00:05:54,519 --> 00:05:56,000
would you leave with him?

87
00:05:59,079 --> 00:06:02,079
(But I don't have any memories
of them at all.)

88
00:06:03,279 --> 00:06:03,759
Well...

89
00:06:04,079 --> 00:06:05,519
Chi Li...

90
00:06:05,519 --> 00:06:06,639
Where is he now?

91
00:06:07,240 --> 00:06:09,639
He left once he knew you were safe.

92
00:06:10,839 --> 00:06:12,519
As for your memories
from your time in Huangyan,

93
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,279
it seems they were stripped away.

94
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:17,319
Do you want to know about your past?

95
00:06:18,519 --> 00:06:19,920
Your name used to be Chi Yuan.

96
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:21,920
(Chi Yuan? Even my name was different.)

97
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:24,120
(Shisi really set me up
with a flimsy backstory.)

98
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:25,439
(I can't talk about this.)

99
00:06:25,639 --> 00:06:27,279
(I'll blow my cover if I slip up.)

100
00:06:27,759 --> 00:06:28,360
Wait.

101
00:06:29,199 --> 00:06:32,000
I actually don't really want to know.

102
00:06:32,199 --> 00:06:34,000
And from the sound of it,

103
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:36,000
my past in Huangyan

104
00:06:36,199 --> 00:06:37,879
wasn't exactly a happy one, was it?

105
00:06:43,199 --> 00:06:44,000
It's alright.

106
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:45,600
Xi Yuan,

107
00:06:46,319 --> 00:06:48,319
I once told you
in the Crimson Lotus Karmic Flame

108
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,800
that the past is in the past.

109
00:06:51,839 --> 00:06:54,639
What matters is the present
and the future.

110
00:06:55,279 --> 00:06:55,879
Right?

111
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,560
If you're still willing
to stay in Huyun,

112
00:06:58,199 --> 00:07:00,839
you can make this place your new home.

113
00:07:04,199 --> 00:07:04,920
Jin Yunlie,

114
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:06,959
ever since I came to Huyun,

115
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,480
you've been the first person
to care about me,

116
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,560
to protect me.

117
00:07:10,279 --> 00:07:11,319
You know, everyone probably

118
00:07:11,519 --> 00:07:13,680
has a past they'd rather not talk about

119
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:15,600
and secrets they don't want to share.

120
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:16,519
Thank you

121
00:07:16,519 --> 00:07:18,959
for never prying into my past.

122
00:07:18,959 --> 00:07:20,319
I'm truly grateful.

123
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:21,759
As for me,

124
00:07:21,759 --> 00:07:23,240
the most important thing right now

125
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:25,720
is to stay by your side.

126
00:07:32,399 --> 00:07:34,480
Now that we've cleared the air,

127
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:35,879
let's leave the past behind.

128
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:38,160
Let's introduce ourselves again.

129
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:39,319
My name is Xi Yuan.

130
00:07:45,639 --> 00:07:46,639
My name is Jin Yunlie.

131
00:08:06,879 --> 00:08:08,360
This lantern is so beautiful.

132
00:08:10,439 --> 00:08:11,480
If you like lanterns,

133
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,000
once we're back
at the Huyun Imperial Palace...

134
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:13,480
Mother!

135
00:08:13,839 --> 00:08:15,199
Mother, don't die! Please!

136
00:08:15,199 --> 00:08:15,839
Mother!

137
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:17,639
Mother!

138
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:18,959
Let's go.

139
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:20,000
Mother!

140
00:08:20,279 --> 00:08:21,839
Mother, don't die! Please!

141
00:08:21,839 --> 00:08:22,560
Mother!

142
00:08:22,839 --> 00:08:24,240
Mother!

143
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:26,040
Xiaoyan!

144
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:27,519
Xiaoyan!

145
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:29,279
What happened?

146
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:32,040
How did this happen?

147
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:32,879
Miss...

148
00:08:33,199 --> 00:08:34,040
Why?

149
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:37,199
Why won't the Huyun Deity
save my mother?

150
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,720
I used all my money

151
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:40,759
to buy the best and most expensive
Spirit Stones.

152
00:08:40,919 --> 00:08:43,200
Why can't they bring my mother
back to life?

153
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:45,360
Xiaoyan, it's your birthday today.

154
00:08:45,759 --> 00:08:48,600
Take this money
and buy yourself some new clothes.

155
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:49,480
Keep it up!

156
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:50,159
Keep it up!

157
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:52,840
The money your mother gave you

158
00:08:52,879 --> 00:08:54,480
and what we made selling lanterns...

159
00:08:54,759 --> 00:08:56,799
Didn't you use it
to hire a Spirit Healer?

160
00:08:57,039 --> 00:08:57,799
Spirit Healer?

161
00:08:57,919 --> 00:08:59,519
What use is a Spirit Healer?

162
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:01,600
Only the Huyun Deity can save my mother!

163
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:07,000
Huyun Deity, I beg you,
please save my mother.

164
00:09:07,559 --> 00:09:08,799
Save my mother.

165
00:09:09,159 --> 00:09:10,279
Please, work a miracle!

166
00:09:10,759 --> 00:09:11,919
Please, work a miracle!

167
00:09:12,159 --> 00:09:13,600
If all this is not enough,

168
00:09:13,879 --> 00:09:15,600
I can offer my heart.

169
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:17,919
I can offer my heart!

170
00:09:19,519 --> 00:09:20,840
Xiaoyan! What are you doing?

171
00:09:21,159 --> 00:09:21,960
Don't do it!

172
00:09:22,840 --> 00:09:25,399
I didn't offer enough Spirit Stones

173
00:09:25,759 --> 00:09:26,799
to prove my devotion.

174
00:09:27,159 --> 00:09:29,919
That's why the great Huyun Deity
won't answer me

175
00:09:29,919 --> 00:09:31,320
or bring my mother back.

176
00:09:31,679 --> 00:09:32,759
It's my fault.

177
00:09:32,919 --> 00:09:34,039
It's all my fault.

178
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:44,480
I'll take care of everything from here.

179
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:46,240
How is this fair?

180
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:49,159
The mother and daughter
were so happy together.

181
00:09:49,879 --> 00:09:52,200
She was still thinking about
making her daughter's birthday noodles.

182
00:09:53,639 --> 00:09:54,440
Deity...

183
00:09:55,919 --> 00:09:57,120
What kind of deity is this?

184
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:00,840
Xi Yuan!

185
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:02,799
Xi Yuan!

186
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,639
What are you doing?

187
00:10:05,679 --> 00:10:07,039
Don't blaspheme the Huyun Deity.

188
00:10:07,279 --> 00:10:07,720
Aren't deities

189
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:10,639
supposed to love all mortals

190
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:12,120
and answer the people's prayers?

191
00:10:13,399 --> 00:10:15,279
This lofty Huyun Deity you speak of?

192
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:16,039
All I see is someone

193
00:10:16,039 --> 00:10:19,000
who endlessly demands
spirit-stone offerings from his people,

194
00:10:19,039 --> 00:10:20,919
who even judges their devotion

195
00:10:20,919 --> 00:10:22,440
by the amount and quality
of their offerings.

196
00:10:22,759 --> 00:10:23,759
This little girl

197
00:10:23,759 --> 00:10:25,440
gave everything she had.

198
00:10:25,639 --> 00:10:27,759
And still she blamed herself
for not being devoted enough.

199
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:30,159
Jin Yunlie, don't you see
how absurd this is?

200
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:33,320
Ever since I came to Huyun...

201
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:34,000
Stop!

202
00:10:35,679 --> 00:10:36,200
Xi Yuan,

203
00:10:37,279 --> 00:10:38,960
all the portraits of the Huyun Deity

204
00:10:39,759 --> 00:10:41,120
were painted by my father himself.

205
00:10:42,799 --> 00:10:44,000
They're linked to his divine sense.

206
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:47,399
They serve as his eyes.

207
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:49,799
Let's talk outside.

208
00:10:51,759 --> 00:10:52,320
Xi Yuan.

209
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:54,879
According to the laws of Huyun,

210
00:10:55,559 --> 00:10:56,639
mortals must revere the deities.

211
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:59,240
Blasphemy is a grave taboo.

212
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:00,120
A grave taboo?

213
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:03,799
Jin Yunlie, is breaking a taboo
all you care about right now?

214
00:11:04,639 --> 00:11:05,399
A girl just lost

215
00:11:05,399 --> 00:11:07,759
her entire family
because she faithfully obeyed

216
00:11:07,759 --> 00:11:09,120
the laws you speak of!

217
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:12,000
Shouldn't the Huyun Deity
save those who suffer?

218
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:14,440
Instead, he exploits their faith

219
00:11:14,639 --> 00:11:16,159
and suffering to enrich himself.

220
00:11:16,159 --> 00:11:17,960
If you're sick, you go see a doctor.

221
00:11:18,639 --> 00:11:20,600
If you have a wish,
you work to fulfill it yourself.

222
00:11:20,799 --> 00:11:23,200
If you want something,
you go after it yourself.

223
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:24,840
What are deities, after all?

224
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:26,080
Deities are nothing more

225
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:27,799
than what people make them out to be!

226
00:11:27,799 --> 00:11:28,759
Enough, Xi Yuan.

227
00:11:30,039 --> 00:11:31,440
What Huyun Deity means to Huyun

228
00:11:31,519 --> 00:11:33,080
is the same as what
the Huangyan Deity means to Huangyan.

229
00:11:33,159 --> 00:11:34,679
Both are supreme beings.

230
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:37,600
If the people have no faith,

231
00:11:38,159 --> 00:11:39,759
Huyun will lose its very foundation.

232
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:41,200
Those words are treasonous.

233
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:42,360
Say no more.

234
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:59,560
♪A love letter, a passionate pursuit,
the envy of everyone♪

235
00:12:00,760 --> 00:12:06,360
♪Bouquets and heartfelt confessions,
leaving me moved and fulfilled♪

236
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:13,160
♪No matter how long or hard our road,
I don't care♪

237
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:19,960
♪But you left me with this pain,
forever beyond redemption♪
